abstract: >-
  A GPU rendering engine for Remotion: keep writing video in React, export on
  the NVIDIA GPU with the CPU free. Layered NVDEC/libplacebo/NVENC pipeline,
  open benchmark, paper and a Claude Code skill.
keywords:
